WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:09.870
Are you okay?

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.970
You can see me?

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:15.680
Huh?

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.830
No, never mind.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.650
Did something sad happen?

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.500
I mean, well...

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.010
You're crying...

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:28.470
You're right.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.160
That's weird...

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.420
I'm not weird!

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.990
Sorry. Are you angry now?

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.400
No, I'm very happy.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.050
I've been alone for such a long time.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:42.270
Just like me...

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.070
You're always alone?

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:44.800
Uh-huh...

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:47.860
I have trouble making friends.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:50.230
We're the same.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:50.980
The same...

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:52.190
Uh-huh.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:56.210
We can be together then?

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.740
Yep! Let's be friends.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:02.750
Uh-huh!

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:07.000
Don't worry.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.760
This won't hurt.

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:22.180
I love you, Taito!

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:36.230
I'm alive...?

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:38.720
What's going on?

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:41.070
So you're the Saitohimea 
I've heard so much about?

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:41.530
Huh?

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:44.180
Nice to meet you.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:45.580
I'm Hinata.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:47.890
Did the church send you?

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:50.090
Give me a break!

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:53.650
I'm not on Ba'alskra's side anymore!

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:56.640
I have no intention 
of removing his seal!

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:57.930
So stop this!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.610
Church? What's that?

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:04.430
M-Monster!

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:06.680
Oh, I see.

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:10.460
You're one of those demon worshipers.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:20.870
Stop!

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:23.200
Taito!

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:29.790
Heh...

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:33.550
L-Let go of Himea!

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:40.470
He still won't die, Saitohimea.

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.660
What kind of power did you grant him?

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:45.560
I'll never tell you!

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.610
Hmm... Doesn't matter.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:56.900
Dammit! Dammit! Dammit!

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.080
Dammit! Dammit!

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:01.690
Why can't I save her?!

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:06.270
Heh, I've killed him six 
times and he's still alive.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:07.670
Taito...

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:10.160
Stop!

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.420
I beg you!

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:15.850
Oh? So he won't keep 
coming back to life?

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:18.300
It only works a certain number of times?

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:23.410
In other words, he won't come back 
to life after dying seven times.

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.470
You shouldn't keep secrets.

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:31.210
The spell is reset after 
fifteen minutes...

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:36.360
Once that happens, he 
can die six more times.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:41.940
That's the curse I placed on Taito...

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:46.280
You're in love with him.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:51.000
You foolishly granted him power...

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:54.020
A power that would prevent 
him from dying...

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:56.440
So he would always be by your side...

00:03:57.220 --> 00:03:59.300
Is that true, Himea...?

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.240
No more...

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:04.890
I'll do whatever you say.

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:08.810
So stop embarrassing 
me in front of Taito...

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.840
He'll cause trouble later,

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:13.510
so I'll erase his memory.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.040
Stop...

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.860
I don't want to forget about Himea!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.280
I...

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.860
I won't forget about you!

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:29.430
I promise to come save you!

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:35.920
So wait for me!

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:38.570
I promise...

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:39.570
I promise that I will...

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:41.670
...never forget...

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.990
Forget about her...

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:46.580
...completely.

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:34.670
Damn you, Hinata!

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:38.220
Hinata...?

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:42.080
How could you mistake me 
for that worthless scum?

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.810
Kurenai Gekkou?!

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:44.630
Huh?

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:47.910
Is your back okay?

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:48.650
Ah...

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:53.830
Why did you attack Himea?!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:57.050
Because Hinata is pursuing her.

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:58.870
I don't know what that means!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:02.770
"900 Seconds of After School <Part Two>"

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:00.040
That's fine.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:01.820
There's no need for 
trash like you to know.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.560
Now hand her over.

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:05.980
Screw that!

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:08.860
Fool.

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.990
Heh, faster than I expected.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.160
But you're no match for me.

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:32.460
I see...

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:36.590
So this is the power granted to the 
unfortunate victim of a vampire.

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:37.350
Gekkou!

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:40.390
I got your coke!

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.380
You took too long!

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:43.740
B-But! You see!

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:46.840
This head was all rolling around, 
and then it combined like "bam"!

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:48.340
It was whacked out!

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:50.740
Ah!

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.490
It's the immortal guy!

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.920
They're enemies.

00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:58.840
Mirai, kill them now.

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:00.500
Enemies?

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:02.470
They're all beat-up...

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:06.390
Don't we look like the bad guys here?

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:09.950
Well, you always look like a bad guy.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:13.010
No, I'm a genius.

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:14.050
Right, right.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.680
An evil genius!

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:16.760
Shut up.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.140
Do as I say.

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:20.390
You belong to me, yes?

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:23.190
B-Belong to you...

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.020
F-Fine.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.820
The curse is lifted!

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:36.450
Time for a fully charged Andu-Mirai!

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:39.120
Wait! S-Seriously?!

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.580
Are you Andou Mirai?!

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.420
Zap away!

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.040
Taito!

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:54.550
Now I zap you again!

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:55.470
Alto!

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:04.130
Whoa! This is crazy!

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:06.790
Uh-oh, Gekkou! I can't move!

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.860
Worthless trash...

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:12.750
The tables are turned.

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:14.500
What are you going to do?

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:17.160
Why don't you start by 
dropping that sword?

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.580
Unless you don't care what 
happens to this hostage?

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:24.080
Let Mirai go.

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:26.410
What?!

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:27.520
No way!

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:29.930
Gekkou's helping me!

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:31.550
Shut up, dead weight.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.690
I'm not doing this for you.

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:36.310
I don't need my sword 
to deal with this trash.

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:38.340
You're free to die.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:39.970
Free to die...?

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:44.470
I'm in a really good mood right now.

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:47.260
So I think I'll try a little harder!

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:53.150
What is this girl?!

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.190
Roar!

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.950
I'm a monster!

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:04.280
Taito!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.060
Whoa, whoa!

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:18.050
How far am I going to fly?!

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:19.590
I caught up!

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.270
You can jump really high.

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:23.720
Honestly...

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:26.470
That's all you have to say?

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.640
If that's the best you can 
manage for a touching reunion,

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:34.250
you won't be popular with the girls.

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:37.030
Actually, I'm not.

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:39.610
You're not?

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:43.120
But you're popular in my 
book, so no problem, right?

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:45.580
I really like you, Taito.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.280
I have a present for you.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:49.980
A present?

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.290
Yep, a present.

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:55.280
Hot!

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:57.530
Of course, it's hot.

00:10:57.530 --> 00:11:00.710
This spell is forbidden, 
even to us vampires.

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:05.620
When we use this fire, it completely 
consumes the upper half of our body.

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:07.780
So if a human like me uses it...?!

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:09.950
I get it... My body is...

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.780
Exactly.

00:11:11.780 --> 00:11:13.310
Use this to defeat him.

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:15.370
There you have it!

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:17.690
This is your last chance to surrender!

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:19.810
Don't make me laugh!

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:21.180
I knew you'd say that!

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:23.070
Exorcise: Spell Error!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.350
Give up already!

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:33.960
You're too cocky for someone who's weak!

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:36.880
Taito!

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:39.550
Gekkou!

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:43.100
I'll help you, Taito!

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:44.440
I'm helping Gekkou!

00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:45.140
Don't need it!

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:50.260
How about I eliminate 
all of you at once?

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:58.300
Taito!

00:11:58.300 --> 00:11:59.150
Gekkou!

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.340
A s-spider?!

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:02.780
And it's huge!

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:03.700
Up there!

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.010
Huh?

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:20.650
Two Gekkous?

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:23.000
N-No, Taito...

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.300
He's after me again...

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:27.790
It's Hinata...

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:32.520
He's the one who...

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:34.280
Don't interfere.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:35.690
I'm going to kill him.

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:37.560
Don't be stupid!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:37.930
He's...

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:39.110
Shut up, trash!

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:43.480
My failure of a twin brother... 
That no-good human trash...

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:45.450
...will die by my hands!

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:47.760
Brother?!

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:51.640
Oh? I wonder who the real failure is.

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:56.430
I see that you're making 
use of my old stuff.

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:58.150
O-Old stuff...?!

00:12:58.150 --> 00:12:59.420
Shut up, Mirai!

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:04.290
I will humiliate him the 
way he humiliated you.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:05.580
Gekkou!

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.240
Can you handle that monster?

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:10.690
Y-Yep! I sure can!

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:12.020
I'll take it out!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:13.670
Okay, so you can handle it.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:16.740
You're quite the dependable partner!

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.420
Wait up!

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:21.980
Wait!

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:24.360
I can do this!

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:26.990
W-We should use this chance 
to run away, Taito!

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:29.580
We can't beat him!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:30.700
He's too strong!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.780
Hey, Himea...

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:40.960
I know that I've kept you 
waiting for nine years...

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:44.340
...but could you wait 
another five minutes?

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:45.490
What?

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:49.900
I'll beat him up real 
quick and come right back.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:51.950
Taito...

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:56.830
I understand. I'll help you fight.

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:00.400
Don't overdo it.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.380
Don't get too confident.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:05.470
You can't beat him by yourself.

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:06.730
Are you sure?

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:10.620
Yes. But together, we 
might stand a chance.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:15.090
Over the past nine years, you've 
become so strong, so cool...

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:16.370
Yeah.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:25.110
I was able to live a normal life...

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:26.920
...because I'd completely 
forgotten about Himea.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:30.290
Still, I didn't spend 
that time doing nothing.

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:33.460
I was pretty good at karate.

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:36.790
But it was probably all for Himea...

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:40.600
So I could protect her 
the next time we met!

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:43.730
Zap away!

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:57.190
Heh, so you've gotten a little better.

00:14:57.590 --> 00:14:59.510
Yeah, just a little.

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:06.130
A little hard work was all it took to 
put me twenty thousand steps ahead of you.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.420
It's over, Hinata.

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:11.120
Twenty thousand steps?

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:14.930
Don't you mean twenty 
thousand steps behind me?

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:26.700
You shouldn't be too impressed 
by your piddling power.

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:31.220
Move, stupid!

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:49.130
Twenty thousand steps ahead, yet 
it takes four of you to fight one.

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:51.170
You never change.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.170
Hey, Kurogane Taito.

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:54.120
Huh?

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:55.620
Lend me a hand.

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:58.690
Oh? You're going to stop being an ass?

00:15:58.690 --> 00:15:59.490
Yeah.

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:03.760
But I'm not so cowardly as to let 
someone insult me and get away with it.

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:09.940
So, any ideas?

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:12.780
Can you do that again?

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:17.870
Then go take him out.

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:19.290
After that...

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:21.940
You're out of options.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:23.670
Let's end this.

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:26.920
A: Do you want me to kill 
everyone besides Saitohimea?

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:34.170
Or B: Do you want to hand her 
over so I might spare your lives?

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:36.010
C: None of the above!

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.060
I'll beat you down and protect Himea!

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.140
I see.

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:44.750
Go!

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.200
Taito!

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:30.930
We did it...

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:38.600
That power is dangerous.

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:41.080
Did you get it from her?

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:42.860
That's not fair.

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:44.950
I spent all that time torturing you,

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:47.000
but you never gave me anything.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:48.830
In any case,

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.590
you pose the most danger 
to me right now.

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:00.780
The sixth time...

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:04.970
So the next death will be his last.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.830
This is exactly how it 
happened nine years ago.

00:18:09.410 --> 00:18:11.880
You people never learn.

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:13.150
Stop this!

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:16.070
Sure, if that's what you want.

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:18.910
But this time, you must promise...

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.200
...to become my slave.

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:24.120
I'll do whatever it is that you want!

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:29.370
So please... spare Taito...

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:33.490
Gekkou!

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:41.140
You can't, Himea...

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:44.940
Don't agree to become his slave...

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:46.690
Don't worry.

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:49.380
I'm going to protect you this time.

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:50.970
Hold on.

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:54.150
I'll go beat him up and come back.

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:56.610
Protect her?

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:59.010
Under these circumstances?

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:02.320
Hey, monster!

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:03.890
No!

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:07.690
It'll be over the next time you die.

00:19:09.570 --> 00:19:13.190
I'm only alive because of Himea.

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:16.770
If I can save her...

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:19.530
Make up for the past nine years...

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:22.650
Ensure that she can go through 
life with a smile on her face...

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:26.470
...you can take my life!

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:27.720
Kurogane!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.300
Fool.

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:32.580
You stand no chance.

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:36.110
Just watch me, stupid!

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.860
I already decided that...

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:42.280
...I would never forget 
about Himea again!

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:47.790
No!

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.250
You fought well for someone who's weak.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:36.210
Don't make me laugh...

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:37.760
Taito...

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:40.400
Taito!

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:42.270
Yeah, sorry.

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:44.800
I made you cry again...

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:46.080
Morning!

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:47.280
Morning!

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:51.750
Hey, wake up!

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:54.790
Huh? I'm alive?

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:58.400
Are you still asleep?

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:00.130
Huh? Who's that?

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.820
A transfer student.

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:08.680
Hi-Himea?!

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:10.330
Taito!

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.650
I missed you so much!

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:17.760
Ow!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:20.670
I-It wasn't a dream?!

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.200
Then why am I...

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:27.240
I missed you... I missed you so much...

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:30.720
No way!

00:21:32.510 --> 00:21:34.230
Ta-Taito...?

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:41.360
Kurenai Gekkou...?

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:44.110
Student Council

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:47.200
Starting today, you're my slave.

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:50.270
You'll be working under 
me in the student council.

00:21:50.270 --> 00:21:51.870
Who are you calling a slave?!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:54.520
You are a lowly slave.

00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:55.870
Or what?

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:57.980
Do I need to beat it into you?

00:21:58.280 --> 00:22:00.120
Bring it!

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:02.150
We can finish yesterday's fight...

00:22:02.510 --> 00:22:05.330
Uh, Himea? Could you let go of me?

00:22:05.330 --> 00:22:06.110
No way.

00:22:06.610 --> 00:22:07.760
No way?

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:10.190
I'm going to be with you forever!

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:11.570
I'm so excited!

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:14.690
Himea...

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:18.020
That settles it. Now scram.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:20.420
Stop ordering me around!

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:23.970
I'm never going to obey you!

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:30.410
This was just the beginning.

00:22:31.220 --> 00:22:38.040
The beginning of the pain-in-the-ass 
story of how our worlds were joined.

00:24:10.610 --> 00:24:12.710
First, I'm dead, then I'm 
brought back to life.

00:24:12.710 --> 00:24:15.380
This incredibly beautiful 
girl says she loves me.

00:24:15.380 --> 00:24:19.010
The arrogant student council 
president treats me like a slave.

00:24:19.010 --> 00:24:22.290
What's going to happen 
to my high school life?!

00:24:22.290 --> 00:24:25.680
Well, I definitely won't 
be bored, at least.

00:24:25.680 --> 00:24:30.360
I mean, Himea's cute, 
soft, smells nice...

00:24:30.360 --> 00:24:31.550
Ignore that!

00:24:31.550 --> 00:24:35.050
Am I supposed to live like this 
for the next three years?!

00:24:35.050 --> 00:24:37.060
Oh, I already died once.

00:24:35.110 --> 00:24:39.980
Next Time:
 "The (Moon) Sways by the Poolside"

00:24:37.060 --> 00:24:39.150
Wait, that's not the point!
